674 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 598 0 R
/E (I want to easily access and update employer details, as well as distinguish between online and offline customer records using record types, allowing for personalized interactions. Additionally, I need the application to automate sales calculations, such as order quantity and total bill amount, to ensure accurate and efficient transactions. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 598 0 R
