/P 655 0 R
/E (In conclusion, the development of TheChaiShop&Co CRM application marks a significant stride in enhancing the store's operational efficiency and customer relationship management capabilities. Seamlessly integrating employer details, customer information \(both online and offline\), and enterprise data, this application streamlines business processes and enables informed decision-making. The automation of sales calculations, including order quantity and total bill amount, reduces errors and empowers employees to focus on delivering exceptional service. Moreover, automated email notifications for customers' birthdays foster personalized communication and enhance customer engagement. )
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [1]
>>
